19. A Minimal Algorithm

function empathic_transfer(video, robot, goal):
    observations = parse_video(video)
    agents = detect_agents(observations)
    for agent in agents:
        other_model =
            infer_agent_model(
                observations,
                agent
            )
        action_ir =
            extract_embodiment_invariants(
                other_model,
                observations
            )
        candidate_actions =
            compile_for_embodiment(
                action_ir,
                robot.self_model
            )
        simulations =
            simulate(
                candidate_actions,
                robot.world_model,
                robot.self_model
            )
        safe_candidates =
            safety_filter(simulations)
        action =
            select_best(
                safe_candidates,
                goal
            )
        result =
            robot.execute(action)
        delta =
            compare(
                predicted=action.predicted_result,
                observed=result
            )
        update_self_model(delta)
        update_world_model(delta)
        update_transfer_model(delta)

The central novelty is not any individual function.

It is the architecture produced by connecting them around self–other equivalence and embodiment-independent action representation.

